      "writtenOn": "2021-08-06T23:25:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hm the point of kindofEquals() is to be lighter-weight than a full comparison...  I realize this keeps the same semantics of what is being compared, but have you looked through the users of this to make sure they really need it?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 459,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 461,
        "endChar": 0
      },
      "revId": "600328e150292275cce234d23f3dd57163e08ca3",
